{"book":"proverbs","num":5,"verses":[{"en":"My son, attend unto my wisdom, and bow thine ear to my understanding:","n":1,"sm":"Lo'u atalii e, ia e faalogo mai i loʻu poto; ia uai mai ou taliga i loʻu faautauta.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Lo'u"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faalogo"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"poto;"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"uai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"taliga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"faautauta."}]},{"en":"That thou mayest regard discretion, and that thy lips may keep knowledge.","n":2,"sm":"Ina ia e tausiusi i le mafaufau; ma ia leoleoina le poto i ou laugutu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tausiusi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mafaufau;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"leoleoina"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"laugutu."}]},{"en":"For the lips of a strange woman drop as an honeycomb, and her mouth is smoother than oil:","n":3,"sm":"Auā e faasisina ifo meli ai laugutu o le fafine ese; o lona gutu foi e sili ona molemole i le suāuu;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Auā"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faasisina"},{"en":"","sm":"ifo"},{"en":"","sm":"meli"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"laugutu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine"},{"en":"","sm":"ese;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"gutu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"molemole"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"suāuu;"}]},{"en":"But her end is bitter as wormwood, sharp as a twoedged sword.","n":4,"sm":"a e mulimuli ane ua oona ia, e pei o le laena; e maamaai o ia, e pei o le pelu ua faatau maai ona itu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"mulimuli"},{"en":"","sm":"ane"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oona"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"pei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"laena;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"maamaai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"pei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pelu"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faatau"},{"en":"","sm":"maai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"itu."}]},{"en":"Her feet go down to death; her steps take hold on hell.","n":5,"sm":"E o ifo ona vae i le oti; e taunuu atu ona laasaga i seoli.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ifo"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"vae"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oti;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"taunuu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"laasaga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"seoli."}]},{"en":"Lest thou shouldest ponder the path of life, her ways are moveable, that thou canst not know them.","n":6,"sm":"Ina neʻi e mafaufau i le ala o le ola, o lea ua feseai ai ona ala; e te le mafai ona e iloa.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"","sm":"neʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"mafaufau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ala"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ola,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"feseai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ala;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"iloa."}]},{"en":"Hear me now therefore, O ye children, and depart not from the words of my mouth.","n":7,"sm":"O lenei, le fanau e, ia outou faalogo mai ia te au; aua foi ne'i “alo ese ourou i upu a lo‘u gutu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","s